[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/comments/304393598","html_url":"https://github.com/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/8603#issuecomment-304393598","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/8603","id":304393598,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMwNDM5MzU5OA==","user":{"login":"TonyApuzzo","id":341037,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTAzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/341037?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo","html_url":"https://github.com/TonyApuzzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-05-26T21:38:38Z","updated_at":"2017-05-26T21:41:29Z","body":"I am experiencing the same problem.  I think it is a bug in the file provisioner or limitation based on the source and destination folders not having the same name.  When the source folder is a directory there is different behavior when the target folder already exists or not.  It also happens when using `vagrant provision` after `vagrant up`\r\n\r\nI have kluged this by using bash script provisioner to move the nested folder contents up a level:\r\n```\r\nVagrant.configure(2) do |config|\r\n  config.vm.provision \"file\", source: \"./config/\", destination: \".vagrant-config/\"\r\n  config.vm.provision \"shell\", inline: <<-SHELL\r\n\tvgConfigDir=/home/vagrant/.vagrant-config\r\n\tif [[ -d \"${vgConfigDir}/config\" ]]; then\r\n\t\techo \"workaround bug https://github.com/mitchellh/vagrant/issues/8603\"\r\n\t\tmv -- \"${vgConfigDir}/config\"/* \"${vgConfigDir}/config/..\"\r\n\t\trmdir -- \"${vgConfigDir}/config\"\r\n\tfi\r\n  SHELL\r\nend\r\n```\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/comments/304393598/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"TonyApuzzo","id":341037,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTAzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/341037?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo","html_url":"https://github.com/TonyApuzzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TonyApuzzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":1180374508,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDExODAzNzQ1MDg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/events/1180374508","actor":{"login":"chrisroberts","id":266674,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NjY3NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266674?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisroberts","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisroberts","followers_url":"https://api.github.com